---
// src/pages/cara-belanja.astro
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="Panduan Cara Belanja - Yasui Game">
    <main class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 pt-24 pb-16">
        <header class="text-center mb-16">
            <h1
                class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-black text-white italic tracking-tighter mb-4"
                data-i18n="guide.title"
            >
                CARA <span class="text-cyan-400">ORDER</span>
            </h1>
            <p
                class="text-gray-400 font-mono text-xs md:text-sm max-w-lg mx-auto"
                data-i18n="guide.subtitle"
            >
                Panduan lengkap berbelanja akun game premium di Yasui Game.
                Aman, Cepat, dan Otomatis.
            </p>
        </header>

        <section class="grid gap-8 relative">
            <div class="hidden md:block absolute left-[2.25rem] top-8 bottom-8 w-1 bg-gradient-to-b from-cyan-500/20 via-cyan-400 to-purple-500/20 -z-10 pointer-events-none"></div>

            <article
                class="cyber-card bg-gray-900/40 border border-gray-800 p-6 md:p-8 flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-6 items-start relative overflow-hidden group hover:border-cyan-400 transition-all duration-300"
            >
                <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 p-4 opacity-10 group-hover:opacity-20 transition pointer-events-none">
                    <div class="i-lucide-search text-6xl md:text-8xl text-cyan-400"></div>
                </div>

                <div
                    class="flex-shrink-0 w-16 h-16 md:w-20 md:h-20 bg-gray-900 border border-gray-700 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center shadow-[0_0_20px_rgba(0,0,0,0.5)] z-10 group-hover:scale-110 transition duration-300 group-hover:border-cyan-400 font-mono"
                >
                    <span class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-black text-cyan-400">01</span>
                </div>

                <div class="flex-1 relative z-10">
                    <h2
                        class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-2 group-hover:text-cyan-400 transition"
                        data-i18n="guide.step1"
                    >
                        PILIH ITEM
                    </h2>
                    <p
                        class="text-gray-400 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4"
                        data-i18n="guide.step1_desc"
                    >
                        Jelajahi katalog game favoritmu (Roblox, MLBB, Genshin,
                        dll). Pilih akun yang sesuai dengan spesifikasi dan
                        budget kamu. Baca deskripsi produk dengan teliti untuk
                        memastikan kelengkapan akun.
                    </p>
                    <div class="flex gap-2 text-[10px] font-mono text-gray-500 uppercase">
                        <span class="bg-black/50 px-2 py-1 border border-gray-800 rounded">Katalog Lengkap</span>
                        <span class="bg-black/50 px-2 py-1 border border-gray-800 rounded">Spesifikasi Detail</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </article>

            <article
                class="cyber-card bg-gray-900/40 border border-gray-800 p-6 md:p-8 flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-6 items-start relative overflow-hidden group hover:border-cyan-400 transition-all duration-300"
            >
                <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 p-4 opacity-10 group-hover:opacity-20 transition pointer-events-none">
                    <div class="i-lucide-user-plus text-6xl md:text-8xl text-cyan-400"></div>
                </div>

                <div
                    class="flex-shrink-0 w-16 h-16 md:w-20 md:h-20 bg-gray-900 border border-gray-700 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center shadow-[0_0_20px_rgba(0,0,0,0.5)] z-10 group-hover:scale-110 transition duration-300 group-hover:border-cyan-400 font-mono"
                >
                    <span class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-black text-cyan-400">02</span>
                </div>

                <div class="flex-1 relative z-10">
                    <h2
                        class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-2 group-hover:text-cyan-400 transition"
                        data-i18n="guide.step2"
                    >
                        MASUKKAN KONTAK
                    </h2>
                    <p
                        class="text-gray-400 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4"
                        data-i18n="guide.step2_desc"
                    >
                        Pada saat checkout, kamu wajib mengisi <strong>Email & Nomor WhatsApp</strong> yang aktif. Ini sangat penting karena detail info login
                        akun (Username/Password) akan dikirimkan secara otomatis ke
                        kontak tersebut.
                    </p>
                    <div
                        class="p-3 bg-yellow-500/10 border-l-2 border-yellow-500 text-[10px] text-yellow-200/80 font-mono"
                        data-i18n="guide.important_typo"
                    >
                        PENTING: Pastikan tidak ada typo agar pengiriman lancar.
                    </div>
                </div>
            </article>

            <article
                class="cyber-card bg-gray-900/40 border border-gray-800 p-6 md:p-8 flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-6 items-start relative overflow-hidden group hover:border-cyan-400 transition-all duration-300"
            >
                <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 p-4 opacity-10 group-hover:opacity-20 transition pointer-events-none">
                    <div class="i-lucide-credit-card text-6xl md:text-8xl text-cyan-400"></div>
                </div>

                <div
                    class="flex-shrink-0 w-16 h-16 md:w-20 md:h-20 bg-gray-900 border border-gray-700 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center shadow-[0_0_20px_rgba(0,0,0,0.5)] z-10 group-hover:scale-110 transition duration-300 group-hover:border-cyan-400 font-mono"
                >
                    <span class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-black text-cyan-400">03</span>
                </div>

                <div class="flex-1 relative z-10">
                    <h2
                        class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-2 group-hover:text-cyan-400 transition"
                        data-i18n="guide.step3"
                    >
                        PEMBAYARAN
                    </h2>
                    <p
                        class="text-gray-400 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4"
                        data-i18n="guide.step3_desc"
                    >
                        Pilih metode pembayaran yang kamu inginkan. Kami
                        mendukung berbagai metode modern:
                    </p>
                    <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3 gap-3">
                        <div
                            class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xs text-gray-300 bg-black/40 p-2 rounded border border-gray-800"
                            data-i18n="guide.payment_qris"
                        >
                            <div class="i-lucide-qr-code text-cyan-400"></div> QRIS (All E-Wallet)
                        </div>
                        <div
                            class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xs text-gray-300 bg-black/40 p-2 rounded border border-gray-800"
                            data-i18n="guide.payment_card"
                        >
                            <div class="i-lucide-credit-card text-cyan-400"></div> VISA / Mastercard
                        </div>
                        <div
                            class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xs text-gray-300 bg-black/40 p-2 rounded border border-gray-800"
                            data-i18n="guide.payment_crypto"
                        >
                            <div class="i-lucide-globe text-cyan-400"></div> Crypto / PayPal
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </article>

            <article
                class="cyber-card bg-gray-900/40 border border-gray-800 p-6 md:p-8 flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-6 items-start relative overflow-hidden group hover:border-green-400 transition-all duration-300"
            >
                <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 p-4 opacity-10 group-hover:opacity-20 transition pointer-events-none">
                    <div class="i-lucide-check-circle text-6xl md:text-8xl text-green-400"></div>
                </div>

                <div
                    class="flex-shrink-0 w-16 h-16 md:w-20 md:h-20 bg-gray-900 border border-gray-700 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center shadow-[0_0_20px_rgba(0,0,0,0.5)] z-10 group-hover:scale-110 transition duration-300 group-hover:border-green-400 font-mono"
                >
                    <span class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-black text-green-400">04</span>
                </div>

                <div class="flex-1 relative z-10">
                    <h2
                        class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-2 group-hover:text-green-400 transition"
                        data-i18n="guide.step4"
                    >
                        TERIMA AKUN
                    </h2>
                    <p
                        class="text-gray-400 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4"
                        data-i18n="guide.step4_desc"
                    >
                        Setelah pembayaran terkonfirmasi (biasanya instan),
                        sistem otomatis kami akan memproses pesananmu. Detail
                        akun akan dikirimkan ke Email dan WhatsApp kamu dalam
                        waktu <strong>1 - 5 menit</strong>.
                    </p>
                    <div class="flex flex-col gap-2 mt-2">
                        <div
                            class="flex items-center gap-2 text-[10px] text-green-400 uppercase font-bold tracking-wider"
                            data-i18n="guide.instant_delivery"
                        >
                            <div class="i-lucide-zap w-4 h-4"></div> Pengiriman Instan 24/7
                        </div>
                        <div
                            class="flex items-center gap-2 text-[10px] text-green-400 uppercase font-bold tracking-wider"
                            data-i18n="guide.warranty"
                        >
                            <div class="i-lucide-shield-check w-4 h-4"></div> Garansi 30 Hari
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </article>
        </section>

        <section class="mt-16 text-center border-t border-gray-800 pt-12">
            <h3 class="text-white font-bold mb-4 text-base" data-i18n="guide.need_help">
                Masih bingung atau ada kendala?
            </h3>
            <a
                href="https://wa.me/6281991400395"
                target="_blank"
                rel="noopener noreferrer"
                class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-green-600 hover:bg-green-500 text-black font-bold uppercase py-3 px-8 rounded shadow-lg hover:shadow-green-500/20 transition transform hover:-translate-y-1"
            >
                <div class="i-lucide-message-circle"></div>
                <span data-i18n="guide.contact_admin">Hubungi Admin WhatsApp</span>
            </a>
            <p
                class="text-[10px] text-gray-500 mt-4 font-mono"
                data-i18n="guide.cs_hours"
            >
                CS Online Setiap Hari: 09:00 - 23:00 WIB
            </p>
        </section>
    </main>
</Layout>
